@ref S 22/2011: paragraph 2 (cancellation), items (a) to (m) (src:TA1999-CANC-S22-2011:33-78)
GIVEN item IS A STRING
GIVETH A MAYBE STRING
`S 22/2011 para 2: the notification named at the item, by its G.N. number` MEANS
    BRANCH IF item EQUALS "a" THEN JUST "G.N. No. 407/2005"
           IF item EQUALS "b" THEN JUST "G.N. No. 409/2005"
           IF item EQUALS "c" THEN JUST "G.N. No. 410/2005"
           IF item EQUALS "d" THEN JUST "G.N. No. 411/2005"
           IF item EQUALS "e" THEN JUST "G.N. No. 412/2005"
           IF item EQUALS "f" THEN JUST "G.N. No. 413/2005"
           IF item EQUALS "g" THEN JUST "G.N. No. S 262/2005"
           IF item EQUALS "h" THEN JUST "G.N. No. S 524/2005"
           IF item EQUALS "i" THEN JUST "G.N. No. 293/2006"
           IF item EQUALS "j" THEN JUST "G.N. No. 1001/2006"
           IF item EQUALS "k" THEN JUST "G.N. No. 119/2007"
           IF item EQUALS "l" THEN JUST "G.N. No. 178/2009"
           IF item EQUALS "m" THEN JUST "G.N. No. 1757/2009"
           OTHERWISE NOTHING

GIVETH A LIST OF STRING
`S 22/2011 para 2: the notifications it names, by G.N. number` MEANS
    LIST "G.N. No. 407/2005", "G.N. No. 409/2005", "G.N. No. 410/2005", "G.N. No. 411/2005", "G.N. No. 412/2005", "G.N. No. 413/2005", "G.N. No. S 262/2005", "G.N. No. S 524/2005", "G.N. No. 293/2006", "G.N. No. 1001/2006", "G.N. No. 119/2007", "G.N. No. 178/2009", "G.N. No. 1757/2009"

GIVEN notification IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`S 22/2011 para 2: the notification is named in the cancellation` MEANS elem notification (`S 22/2011 para 2: the notifications it names, by G.N. number`)

GIVEN `conduct day` IS A DATE
      `reading day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`S 22/2011: the cancellation is in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day (first published 17 January 2011, in operation 21 January 2011)` MEANS
        `conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 21 1 2011)
    AND `reading day` AT LEAST (Date 17 1 2011)

